Reranker measurement with windowed scoring (Follow_Ups RAG-1 continuation; plans/2026-09-13-reranker-windows.md Milestone 2 with Amendment 1;
plans/2026-09-13-reranker.md Milestone 3 rule and Amendment 2 in force), 2026-09-13
Branch reranker from d08b8e0 (windowed scoring commit a791a8d plus plan amendment 1). No code change under test; set v2 (evaluation/retrieval-set-v2.json,
42 questions), window 10, hybrid on, k 60, weights vector 1.0 / keyword 0.5 / figure 1.0, candidateCount 40. Cross-encoder cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2,
rerankerVersion 5d3e70fd0c9f, passage-scoring max-window (default), max-windows 4 (default), window-overlap-tokens 64 (default) or 224 (run 5).

Harness (one application start per configuration; the application enable flags never exported; every override is an environment variable of the run shell only):
  set -a && source .env && set +a && export INTEGRATION_ACCESS_TOKEN=<32+ chars> SERVER_PORT=8081 RAG_CROSS_ENCODER_ENABLED=true [RAG_RETRIEVAL_RERANK_CANDIDATES=<n>]
      [RAG_RETRIEVAL_RERANK_TIMEOUT_MS=4000] [RAG_RETRIEVAL_CROSS_ENCODER_WINDOW_OVERLAP_TOKENS=224]
  nohup ./mvnw -q -o spring-boot:run > app-<config>.log 2>&1 &   ; wait for "Started StockRecommendationEngineApplication"; the "Cross-encoder loaded ... scoring=" line
      confirms the overlap in effect (max-window/overlap=64/maxWindows=4, or max-window/overlap=224/maxWindows=4 in run 5)
  warm-up: POST /api/rag/retrieve {"ticker":"NVDA","query":"What was NVIDIA gross margin in fiscal 2026?","rerank":true}   (topK 5; Amendment 2, so no evaluation call is a cold start)
  POST /api/rag/evaluate?rerank=<true|false> with Authorization: Bearer <token>   (properties.rerankCandidates and properties.rerankerScoring confirm the overrides)
  select row_to_json(r) from retrieval_evaluations r where id=<id>   -> snapshot-<id>-<config>.json
  pkill -f spring-boot:run; pkill -f StockRecommendationEngineApplication; lsof -i :8081 empty ("port free") after every run
  No chat model. Embeddings: 42 per evaluation (5 runs) + 1 per warm-up (5) + 1 diagnostic warm-up + 9 diagnostic retrievals + 42 for the floor test = 267.

